{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0e63bc7d5bc94273d03fe1ad7fbc97c678fce786698c652046fda13f837f620f", "ja": "（届いたばかりの真の新曲、かなり良い感じだな！\nさっそく聞かせてあげたいけど……真はどこだろう？）", "zh": "（刚收到的真酱的新歌，感觉相当不错啊！\n虽然想马上放给她听……可真在哪里呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1001_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "f087fe312e834fb0a1128f786e6cf49bbf5af9408f6e9a86e53b7e1cc3e87174", "ja": "つまり、左足は体の外側をグルッてなぞっていって、\n体の真横に来たら……シュバッ！　……って感じで。", "zh": "也就是说，左脚要沿着身体外侧绕一圈，到了身体正侧面时……唰！大概就是这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "6bc78e1c3c28aadf4dd0404727444e85ffa6b88addf70cf030488f38f6f2cacb", "ja": "グルッとなぞって、真横で……シュバッ！\n……あっ。で、できたかも……？", "zh": "绕着描一圈，到了正侧面……唰！\n……啊。好、好像做到了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b72f9cb0ece21f578e5e3ea592b0a092779da04fb0231a45b6b10cee7f937d03", "ja": "いつもここで、遅れてたけど、\n今のタイミングだったら……。", "zh": "平时总是在这里慢一拍，\n但要是刚才那个时机的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "10cf4e956bc3453f79aee01533faa009b015f013cf028e09d8992f114ebb0d2b", "ja": "うん、今のでバッチリだよ、ふたりとも！\nじゃあ、せっかくだから、次の動きも……あっ。", "zh": "嗯，刚才那个时机正好，两个人都做得很棒！\n既然难得有这个机会，那就连下一个动作也……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1006_p", "source_sha256": "131220f43906590fa9be72c024e09e417651bb3e67ed3ff604f05228aae7f4aa", "ja": "あ、真。探したよ。\nダンスの指導だなんて、頼もしいな！", "zh": "啊，真。找到你了。\n没想到你要指导舞蹈，真可靠啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "c072d43c4daf341678e53b9f1a9bdb72f1c900c038401f4233430e6e0ec5f677", "ja": "そんな、頼もしいだなんて……えへ、えへへ。", "zh": "哪有，你还夸我可靠……嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "32ba3774772fed4a1f45fa30e9c32ea2831a665173c3d8de5791dd235685a14e", "ja": "あ、それで、ボクを探してたって、\n何か用ですか？", "zh": "啊，所以你是在找我啊。有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1009_p", "source_sha256": "70386b5e52b5b67adb50308fae290ee9b2143f389208c80be0d01dd64e068159", "ja": "ああ。次のセンター公演を真にお願いするって話は\n伝えていただろ？", "zh": "啊。关于下次中心公演要拜托真担任中心这件事，我之前已经告诉过你了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "7a0a11b943c808a395d5823a08829273a8113abe51b34b8068e797fb04a1e5e1", "ja": "はい！　紬に可憐、それに翼と海美が\n共演してくれる予定なんですよね？", "zh": "是的！　听说紬、可怜，还有翼和海美都会预定参加演出，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1011_p", "source_sha256": "02ed47cd546404861a1ea887efb241f7a35694a6908993af181745b65c038dab", "ja": "ああ。それで、その公演で披露する新曲なんだけど……\nようやく届いたんだ！", "zh": "啊。然后，是要在那场公演上演出的新歌……\n终于送到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "73cd985255092212006cb62bb76602d0f729747dad1181ec6cbb9640c1ea117a", "ja": "ほ、ほんとですか！？　うわぁ、楽しみだったんです！\nどんな曲なんだろ……今すぐ聞かせてください！！", "zh": "真、真的吗！？　哇，我可是一直很期待的！\n会是什么样的曲子呢……请现在就放给我听吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1013_p", "source_sha256": "95ae442530a0450bb4a0da39d23601f8940b6295d5e2d11854186529f49937e4", "ja": "あ、ああ。もちろんそのつもりだから、\n落ち着いてくれ。それじゃあ、さっそく流すぞ……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊。当然就是这么打算的，\n你先冷静一下。那么，马上就播放了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "3187da49888f8fbedc5862e6f5d5400c38fa998520b75913e901109e56bd102a", "ja": "うわ～……。これがボクの新曲かぁ……！\nすごくダンサブルで、ウズウズしてきちゃいました。", "zh": "哇～……。这就是我的新歌啊……！\n节奏感好强，我都跃跃欲试、按捺不住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "443f43bc9e25cb89e53087ddc05f0a57ee1b9c4cebfe6b5dc2c26d147d0594a5", "ja": "歌詞もすっごくいいですよね。なりたい自分に\nみんなを変える……って感じなのかな……？", "zh": "歌词也特别棒，对吧。感觉是要让大家都变成自己想成为的样子……是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1017_p", "source_sha256": "944faa77cdb988aff3b313994a81fd698f2df6948ab77623098cf6dee1f3831b", "ja": "気に入ってくれてよかったよ。今回は真の持ち味である\n明るさや元気のよさが映えるようにしてもらったんだ。", "zh": "你喜欢就好。这次特意让歌曲更能展现真最擅长的明快与活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "629e2cdf07889742357e81e2d50482b58203ab034a6cde4e326bd1a58410c6a7", "ja": "ボクの持ち味かぁ……。たしかに、聞いているだけで\nダンスのイメージも湧き上がってきます。……そうだ！", "zh": "我的特色啊……确实，光是听着就能浮现出舞蹈的画面。……对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "2826e945994ca5d35ec2491efebf0dd0b12a88c41273df72e04b9682d05b690a", "ja": "{$P$}。今回の曲の振り付け……\nボクに考えさせてください！", "zh": "{$P$}。这次歌曲的编舞……\n请让我来设计！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0f0676ed8c3376a49c7bfb1951062511243d8edb6393420ced229f6997359583", "ja": "え？　ふ、振り付けを……ご自分で？\nすごいです。そんなことまでできるなんて……。", "zh": "诶？您、您要亲自编舞……？\n真厉害，居然连这种事都能做到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "baa04842d98693dd30f9e7f4d7f7bf5f9f525beaab2711f3bcea120a135089ac", "ja": "いや、やったことないんだけどね。でも、イメージが\n湧いちゃって……せっかくだから、挑戦したい。", "zh": "虽然我从没做过就是了。不过，脑海里突然有了灵感……难得有这个机会，我想挑战一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "5854d59242b1d808e80084225d7a4e7a0feab5b5ab79211a33994240545e75ae", "ja": "ボクなりに全力で、\nダンスに力を入れた公演にしたいって思ったんだ！", "zh": "我想用自己的方式全力以赴，办一场着重于舞蹈的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "e5fbb8bdf4cde6489cee45fddba0ec164282cd6bcd4466d06a29bab2602c9708", "ja": "だ、ダンスに……力を……。あ、あの、私、普通の\nダンスでもちゃんと踊れるか、心配で……。", "zh": "舞、舞蹈要……加大力度……那、那个，我担心自己就连普通的舞蹈都不一定能跳好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "008411b89d658da6e9ad39dea29b60c8ffef62a194e5d073ab3794d010bde0db", "ja": "私も……。菊地さんと高坂さん、それに伊吹さんも\nダンスはお上手なので、足を引っ張らないかと……。", "zh": "我也是……菊地小姐、高坂小姐，还有伊吹小姐都很擅长跳舞，我担心自己会不会拖大家后腿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "0fadea65227b54a1d81bc957066dec810b66f15d8c1861167ee3061faa6ba6e9", "ja": "大丈夫、ボクが教えるから！\n紬も可憐も、踊れるようになれるなら、なりたいよね？", "zh": "没事的，我来教你们！\n紬和可怜，如果能学会跳舞的话，也是想学会的对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "97bad4565009bea779b3abe8a3ce712a6a03abda157c6d4eeb11a2c139dec2c7", "ja": "は、はい！\nもちろん、踊れるようになりたいです！", "zh": "是、是的！\n当然想变得更会跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "66492b0285cb51aa496883fd54814d7a250f43f7d5dabfb1d7bdacccd35aa5ae", "ja": "わ、私も……もっと、ダンスを踊れるようになりたい\nです。だから……お、教えてください！", "zh": "我、我也想……把舞跳得更好。\n所以……请、请教教我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "4da8f8bab683aad770d0c226844c423973dbf6ea7cd32437c10ec7c5330dc62b", "ja": "なら大丈夫！　なりたい自分に、ボクが変えてあげる！\nなんて、ちょっと言い過ぎかな……。", "zh": "那就没问题了！我会让你成为理想中的自己！\n嘿嘿……是不是有点说过头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "b61ba1584b8afa04b80e7c13836be1434d7a0add9b1152d0ef3e011b7832c231", "ja": "でも、大切なのはハートだから！\n……あ、いいですか、{$P$}？", "zh": "但是，最重要的是心意！  \n……啊，可以吗，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1030_p", "source_sha256": "4aea25022b491a258444f9c828b3b84b181ef81c419a9eeb74ef83ce8afcd459", "ja": "そうだな。振り付けの発注はまだだし、\n何より、真のためにもなりそうだし……。", "zh": "是啊。舞蹈编排还没安排，\n更重要的是，这对真来说应该也有好处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1031_p", "source_sha256": "a3a422026147642955b1244e2077dd4d9d8af900dccd16ba93865b7325be5323", "ja": "よし！\n新曲の振り付けとレッスン、真に任せるよ！", "zh": "好！\n新歌的编舞和练习，就交给真了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_079_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_079_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "88d8ebbb5c56895fb9141fc1118bb4e941b4d1b708343e067efa6adc62dc07bb", "ja": "やーりぃ！\nそれじゃあ、可憐、紬、よろしくね！", "zh": "太棒啦！\n那么，可怜、紬，请多指教啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
